content_en:
Updated:
· The quick test is officially renamed Verity personality test, domain changed to solyoung.top/Verity/;
· clicking the homepage portrait smoothly scrolls to the email and 100-hour countdown at the bottom, visible on one screen.

Face-lift:
· Homepage portrait upgraded to a 1080 high-res version, finer detail and brushwork;
· added preload — high-res but the first screen isn't slowed.

Polished the archive intro:
· Archived text moved below the archive frame, no longer covering the photo;
· mobile hint changed to 'long-press and drag into the archive frame' for touch drag.

Site changelog:
· Launched the 'digital archive entry' intro experience: drag the avatar into the archive frame to open SolYoung's archive;
· full experience on first visit, afterward it only flashes briefly and doesn't disturb;
· footer has a REPLAY INTRO to replay anytime; supports reduced-motion and touch.

Site changelog:
· Footer 100-hour countdown moved to right below 'We record so we can forget', above the copyright, switched to a more stable numeral font (clearer on mobile);
· All site images compressed to WebP with lazy loading: camera-simulator logo dropped from 1.6MB to ~4KB, total homepage images from ~2.6MB to ~130KB; noticeably faster in China.

Site changelog:
· Footer added a 100-hour loop countdown, precise to the second, auto-restarts when it hits zero;
· with a note: every 100 hours, this site and everything I create keeps changing. Added or removed, always moving toward something better.

Site changelog:
· Added a zh/en language toggle in the top-right; the whole site's copy switches between Chinese and English with one click;
· covers nav, hero, section titles, independent products, about, contact and footer;
· language choice is remembered and kept on next visit.

Site changelog:
· Removed the 'Discussion' section — comments were unusable on China's network, deleted entirely;
· Works and About titles now link to subpages; added standalone works/ and about/ pages;
· About page: SolYoung main title emphasized, subtitle moved to small text below;
· Added a row of quick-nav boxes below the homepage hero (Works/Now/Thoughts/About);
· Removed the right-side vertical section nav.
